From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jensen Huang <jensenhuang@friendlyarm.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:25:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: rk3399: split nanopi-r4s out of evb_rk3399

Add a NanoPi 4 series board target that detects the board revision
(GPIO4_D0/D1 + SARADC channel 4) and selects the matching DDR
parameters in TPL, so that the NanoPi R4S 1GB (DDR3) boots next to
the 4GB (LPDDR4) variant.

Signed-off-by: Jensen Huang <jensenhuang@friendlyarm.com>
[ported to U-Boot 2025.10: use generic rockchip misc_init_r() for
 cpuid/MAC, set SARADC clock through the clk API, drop ATAG defines]
---
 arch/arm/dts/rk3399-nanopi-r4s-u-boot.dtsi |   2 +
 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3399/Kconfig      |   6 +
 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/Kconfig          |  15 ++
 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/MAINTAINERS      |   6 +
 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/Makefile         |   8 +
 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/hwrev.c          | 196 +++++++++++++++++++++
 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/hwrev.h          |  13 ++
 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/nanopi4.c        |  22 +++
 configs/nanopi-r4s-rk3399_defconfig        |   2 +-
 include/configs/nanopi4.h                  |  19 ++
 10 files changed, 288 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/Kconfig
 create mode 100644 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/MAINTAINERS
 create mode 100644 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/Makefile
 create mode 100644 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/hwrev.c
 create mode 100644 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/hwrev.h
 create mode 100644 board/friendlyarm/nanopi4/nanopi4.c
 create mode 100644 include/configs/nanopi4.h

